Cmn1=SIMPLWINDOWS NAME: Marantz CC4300 CD Changer\\\\MANUFACTURER: Marantz\\MODEL:
Cmn2=||1CC4300 CD Changer\\\\CATEGORY: TRANSPORT DECKS\\\\VERSION: 1.0\\\\SUMMARY:
Cmn3=||1Emulates the remote control\\\\\\GENERAL NOTES: This module emulates||1
Cmn4=the keys of the remote\\control. The CC4300 does not provide feedback.
Cmn5=\\\\NOTE: The repeat modes are 1 track/1 disc/all discs/off.\\NOTE:
Cmn6=||1The repeat A-B modes are A/A-B/off.\\\\CRESTRON HARDWARE REQUIRED:
Cmn7=||1CNCOMH-2, CNXCOM, ST-COM, C2COM\\\\\\SETUP OF CRESTRON HARDWARE:
Cmn8=||1\\Baud Rate - 9600\\Parity - None\\Data Bits - 8\\Stop Bits - 1\\\\\\VENDOR||1
Cmn9=FIRMWARE: None\\\\\\VENDOR SETUP: None\\\\\\CABLE NUMBER: CNSP-121\\\\\\INPUT||1
Cmn10=DESCRIPTIONS: \\\\Name             Type Description\\\\Power_On/Off/Tog||1
Cmn11=||2D  Turn the system on and off. The on and off\\||?
Cmn12=||7are discreet commands.\\Disc_*             D  Select the||1
Cmn13=disc.\\Play               D  Start the CD playing\\Stop||9
Cmn14=||6D  Stop the CD\\Pause              D  Pause the CD\\Skip-/+||1
Cmn15=||;D  Skip to the next/prev chapter\\Search_*||;
Cmn16=D  Scan the CD.\\Repeat             D  Cycles through the repeat||1
Cmn17=modes. 1 track/1 disc/all discs/off\\A-B                D  Cycles||1
Cmn18=through the repeat A-B modes. A/A-B/off\\Random             D  Cycles||1
Cmn19=through the random modes. 1 disc/all discs\\Program            D||1
Cmn20=||1Enters and exits program mode.\\Delete             D  Entera and||1
Cmn21=exits delete mode.\\Intro              D  Cycles through the intro||1
Cmn22=modes. 1 disc/all discs/off\\Edit               D  Cycles through||1
Cmn23=the edit modes. auto edit/edit/off\\T.Size             D  Selects||1
Cmn24=the tape size in edit recording.\\Display_Dimmer     D  Toggles||1
Cmn25=the brightness of the display.\\Time               D  Cycles through||1
Cmn26=the time display modes.\\                      elapsed time/remaining||1
Cmn27=track time/ remaining disc time\\Key_*              D  Used for||1
Cmn28=entering disc or track number to play.\\\\\\OUTPUT DESCRIPTIONS:
Cmn29=||1\\\\Name             Type Description\\\\To_Device$         S||2
Cmn30=Serial signal to be routed to a 2-way RS232 port\\\\OPS USED FOR||1
Cmn31=TESTING: 5.12.63x\\2 SERIES OPS USED FOR TESTING: 2.004\\\\COMPILER||1
Cmn32=USED FOR TESTING: SimplWindows Ver 2.02.11\\\\SAMPLE PROGRAM: Marantz||1
Cmn33=CC4300 CD Changer Demo\\\\REVISION HISTORY: None\\
